{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"Let's find the limit as $x$ approaches $-3$. We will use the fact that $h(x)=2x+1$ for $x$-values smaller than $-2$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to -3}h(x)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to -3}2x+1\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2(-3)+1\u0026\\gray{\\text{Direct substitution}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-5\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, we found that $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to -3}h(x)=-5$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"$h(x)=\\begin{cases}\n2x+1\u0026\\text{for }x\u003c-2\n\\\\\\\\\n\\dfrac{1}{x-1}\u0026\\text{for }-2\\leq x\u003c1\n\\end{cases}$\n\n**Find $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to -3}h(x)$.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$-5$","correct":true},{"content":"$-3$","correct":false},{"content":"$-\\dfrac14$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"content":"The limit doesn't exist.","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":false,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":false,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
